{
  "message": "Your latest devlog reports polish, a published build and a cut video, but no build or player findings were shown. Across these weeks, preparation tasks were completed, but reports of islands and testing never established a playable slice. The 28-day goal was missed because the two-island tide loop, co-op sailing and five-player test remain unverified. Missing evidence is common and can be addressed at the next checkpoint. Start there by attaching the playable build and five-player findings, showing which parts they tested. I look forward to your next checkpoint’s devlogs, artifacts and test notes ;).",
  "agreed": []
}

